                             plus new screen streaming / PC control handling
  web/phone/teacher.html   - the drawing page (from inkcast.py's tablet page),
                             restyled, new toolbar layout, pinch zoom, Control PC

Tools SCraMic Share downloads when first needed (not bundled; pinned ones are checked against a SHA-256):
  UxPlay for Windows (AirPlay receiver)   https://github.com/leapbtw/uxplay-windows   GPL-3.0, run as a separate program
  scrcpy (Android screen mirroring)       https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy        Apache-2.0, run as a separate program
  Android SDK Platform-Tools (adb)        https://developer.android.com/tools/releases/platform-tools  Google's license
  UnityCapture (virtual camera filter)    https://github.com/schellingb/UnityCapture  MIT
  VB-CABLE (virtual audio cable)          https://vb-audio.com/Cable/                 Donationware by VB-Audio

